    "notes": "Silent video, no amounts shown: all quantities are my estimates. The first pan (poha, puffed rice, chana, then makhana) is on an induction top; the mix is set aside in a bowl before the ghee pan (the move is not shown). The pinkish powder at the end looks like pink or black salt. Roasting times are not shown, and cooling before storing is not shown. No creator name on screen (Country Delight is a product brand)."
